Z||000008||Shaft||12-29-2001||03:08 PM||||If you were to put a second engine in the front you would need another transmission too. It is possible. In the new Sport Compact Car theres a guy that put 2 engines in his Hyundai Tiberon. The car is a lot heavier, but he did a few mods to the engines (turbos, fuel injectors, fuel pumps, and it runs on methanol) and it runs 10 second quarters.||||reg||1
